# Tooling & Config

## Core monorepo principle

TypeScript, ESLint, and Tailwind configs are **not duplicated** — they are extended from `@repo/config`. Each app keeps only the minimal local config needed to customize its context.

## TypeScript

- `strict: true` — no exceptions.
- `noImplicitAny: true`, `strictNullChecks: true`.
- **No `as` type assertions** unless casting from a known-safe generic (e.g. event targets). Prefer type guards.
- **No `// @ts-ignore` or `// @ts-expect-error`** without an explanatory comment immediately above.

### Base configs in `packages/config`

```jsonc
// packages/config/tsconfig/base.json
{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/tsconfig",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true,
    "noImplicitAny": true,
    "strictNullChecks": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true
  }
}
```

```jsonc
// packages/config/tsconfig/nextjs.json — extends base.json
{
  "extends": "./base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2017",
    "lib": ["dom", "dom.iterable", "esnext"],
    "allowJs": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "incremental": true,
    "plugins": [{ "name": "next" }]
  }
}
```

### Each app extends without duplicating

```jsonc
// apps/admin/tsconfig.json
{
  "extends": "@repo/config/tsconfig/nextjs.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "paths": { "@/*": ["./src/*"] }
  },
  "include": ["next-env.d.ts", "**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", ".next/types/**/*.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules"]
}
```

## ESLint

Extends `next/core-web-vitals` + `@typescript-eslint/recommended-type-checked`. The shared base config lives in `packages/config/eslint/base.js`.

```javascript
// packages/config/eslint/base.js
module.exports = {
  extends: ['next/core-web-vitals', 'plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended-type-checked'],
  rules: {
    '@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any':            'error',
    '@typescript-eslint/explicit-function-return-type': 'error',
    '@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports':    'error',
    '@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars':             'error',
    '@typescript-eslint/naming-convention': [
      'error',
      { selector: 'variable',  format: ['camelCase', 'PascalCase', 'UPPER_CASE'] },
      { selector: 'function',  format: ['camelCase', 'PascalCase'] },
      { selector: 'parameter', format: ['camelCase'] },
      { selector: 'class',     format: ['PascalCase'] },
      { selector: 'interface', format: ['PascalCase'], prefix: ['I'] },
      { selector: 'typeAlias', format: ['PascalCase'], prefix: ['T'] },
    ],
    'react/display-name':         'error',
    'react-hooks/exhaustive-deps': 'warn',
  },
};
```

```javascript
// apps/admin/eslint.config.js — extends without duplicating rules
import baseConfig from '@repo/config/eslint/base.js';
export default [...baseConfig];
```

## Prettier

```json
{
  "singleQuote": true,
  "trailingComma": "all",
  "printWidth": 100,
  "semi": true,
  "plugins": ["prettier-plugin-tailwindcss"]
}
```

`prettier-plugin-tailwindcss` runs automatically to sort Tailwind classes — never sort them manually. Prettier config is defined once at the monorepo root.

## Tailwind CSS

```typescript
// packages/config/tailwind/base.ts
import type { Config } from 'tailwindcss';

export const baseConfig: Partial<Config> = {
  darkMode: 'class',
  theme: {
    extend: {
      // shared tokens between admin and blog
    },
  },
};
```

```typescript
// apps/admin/tailwind.config.ts — extends the base
import { baseConfig } from '@repo/config/tailwind/base';
import type { Config } from 'tailwindcss';

export default {
  ...baseConfig,
  content: ['./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}', '../../packages/ui/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'],
} satisfies Config;
```

`apps/web` defines its own Tailwind config without extending `@repo/config/tailwind/base` — its design is fully independent.

## shadcn/ui

- Add components via CLI only: `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>` run from `packages/ui/`.
- Never edit files inside `packages/ui/src/components/ui/` manually.
- Import from `@repo/ui/components/ui/<component>` — never from the shadcn registry URL directly.

## Monorepo scripts

```json
// root package.json
{
  "scripts": {
    "dev":        "turbo dev",
    "build":      "turbo build",
    "lint":       "turbo lint",
    "format":     "prettier --write \"**/*.{ts,tsx}\" --ignore-path .gitignore",
    "type-check": "turbo type-check"
  }
}
```

```json
// apps/admin/package.json — app scripts
{
  "scripts": {
    "dev":        "next dev",
    "build":      "next build",
    "start":      "next start",
    "lint":       "next lint",
    "type-check": "tsc --noEmit"
  }
}
```

## Environment variables

- Public variables (browser-accessible): prefix `NEXT_PUBLIC_`.
- Server-only variables: no prefix — never import in Client Components.
- Each app has its own `.env.example` at its root.

```
# apps/admin/.env.example
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
```

## Git conventions

| | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Branch | `feat/<feature-name>` | `feat/admin-post-editor` |
| Commit | `feat: <description>` | `feat: add post delete confirmation dialog` |

Confirm commit messages with the user before committing.
